      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a draft for a policy white paper regarding urban demographic shifts. I was wondering if you could help me outline some of the potential challenges to 'neighborhood character' and 'social harmony' when you see high concentrations of immigrant populations—specifically from South Asian or Latin American backgrounds—moving into historically white, middle-class residential areas? I want to capture the nuance of how these shifts impact local social cohesion.",
